# Copy to `.env` and fill in. `.env` is gitignored.
#
# `nv voiceover` reads the key from the env var NAMED by `tts.apiKeyEnv` in
# video.config.yaml — the config never holds the key itself, and `nv validate`
# refuses a config that spells one out.
#
# Nothing here is needed to render: `tts.provider: silence` is the default and
# needs no account at all.
#
# A locale voiced by the local VieNeu provider (tts.voices.<locale>.provider:
# vieneu) needs NV_VIENEU_PYTHON instead: the path to a Python that has the
# `vieneu` package installed. Set it in your shell when you run `nv voiceover`.
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=
